  "title": "Soft and Chewy Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "These chocolate chip cookies made with margarine instead of butter are wonderfully soft and chewy. You won't be able to stop eating them!",
  "authors": [
    "Becel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-05-05T18:31:25-04:00",
